{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765756,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Fun Challenge","festival_id":504454,"organization_id":675999,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-18T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/fun-challenge-techfest26-annual-technical-festival-of-sliet-sant-longowal-institute-of-engineering-and-tech-1765756","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Fun Challenge &ndash; Aarambh'26:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Fun Challenge is a three-round knockout team event designed to provide students with an enjoyable and competitive experience through communication, coordination, speed, teamwork and physical fun under Aarambh'26 at SLIET Longowal. The event follows a knockout format of 14 teams &rarr; 10 teams &rarr; 6 teams &rarr; 1 overall winner.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 16\/09\/2026 (Wednesday)<\/li>\n<li>Time: 4:30 P.M.<\/li>\n<li>Venue: Student Activity Centre (SAC) \/ New EE-Block<\/li>\n<li>Team Size: 2 Players per team (Total 14 teams = 28 participants)<\/li>\n<li>Format: 3-Round Knockout Tournament<\/li>\n<li>Participation: Open to all college and diploma students<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rounds Breakdown:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Whisper Challenge:<\/strong> Each pair: 1 player wears headphones and guesses; 1 partner gives silent clues. Time: 2 minutes per team. Each correct guess = 1 point. Top 10 teams qualify. (30-second sudden-death tiebreaker if needed).<\/li>\n<li><strong>Round 2 &ndash; Three-Leg Relay:<\/strong> 10 qualified pairs. Partners' adjacent legs bound with soft ribbons. Parallel lane race from start to opposite line and back. Fastest completion time qualifies. Top 6 pairs reach the final.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Round 3 &ndash; Water Cup Challenge (Grand Finale):<\/strong> 6 finalist pairs compete simultaneously. Cup-to-cup water transfer relay into the team bucket in 2 minutes. At the whistle, all buckets are measured. Team with maximum water = Overall Champion!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>All teams get the same equipment, distance and time conditions.<\/li>\n<li>Coordinators explain the rules before each round.<\/li>\n<li>Report at the venue at least 15 minutes before time.<\/li>\n<li>No intentional interference, pushing or unsafe behaviour. Immediate disqualification for foul play.<\/li>\n<li>Stop play immediately if someone falls or feels unsafe.<\/li>\n<li>For Three-Leg Relay, soft and comfortable bindings are used; not tied too tightly.<\/li>\n<li>For Water Challenge, clean spills immediately to prevent slipping.<\/li>\n<li>Event flow: 14 &rarr; 10 &rarr; 6 &rarr; 1.<\/li>\n<li>The organizing committee's decisions on results are final and binding.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Benefits &amp; Outcomes:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Promotes teamwork, communication, and quick execution.<\/li>\n<li>Encourages coordination and quick thinking.<\/li>\n<li>Creates an enjoyable and energetic student pre-fest activity.<\/li>\n<li>Participation certificates &amp; excellence prizes for winners.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":27463276,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:13+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:00:05+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"TwNiaQL","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_c